"`8c2cd6cf1f1 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8c2cd6cf1f1>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Frame buffer source selector, streaming-mode selector, and format "
"readout** (`e76284bde9e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e76284bde9e>`__, `76448d7b9dd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/76448d7b9dd>`__, `afece31cb6a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/afece31cb6a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**影格緩衝區來源選擇器、串流模式選擇器與格式讀數** (`e76284bde9e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e76284bde9e>`__, `76448d7b9dd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/76448d7b9dd>`__, `afece31cb6a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/afece31cb6a>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Histograms are computed from full 8-bit RGB**, with a shared plot palette "
"(`238e099373e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/238e099373e>`__, "
"`f126e8f34c0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f126e8f34c0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**直方圖改由完整的 8 位元 RGB 計算**，並採用共用的繪圖調色盤 (`238e099373e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/238e099373e>`__, `f126e8f34c0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f126e8f34c0>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Third-party board firmware** -- a vendor's repository of boards and "
"firmware installed alongside the Viewer is used for firmware updates, "
"including the vendor's own development channel; the Viewer installs only the"
" firmware part of a repository (`21a63a74949 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/21a63a74949>`__, `b15afdac479 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b15afdac479>`__, `b04da8ee888 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b04da8ee888>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**第三方開發板韌體**\\ ——與 Viewer 一同安裝的供應商開發板與韌體儲存庫會用於韌體更新，包括該供應商自己的開發通道；Viewer "
"只會安裝儲存庫中的韌體部分 (`21a63a74949 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/21a63a74949>`__, `b15afdac479 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b15afdac479>`__, `b04da8ee888 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b04da8ee888>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:66
msgid ""
"**OpenMV N6 Classic** and **FLIR Lepton 3.1R / UW** support (`4ff4a1f239d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4ff4a1f239d>`__, `bdd6c96ef47 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bdd6c96ef47>`__, `25fcdc13c6a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/25fcdc13c6a>`__, `12c03024f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/12c03024f3c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV N6 Classic** 與 **FLIR Lepton 3.1R／UW** 支援 (`4ff4a1f239d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4ff4a1f239d>`__, `bdd6c96ef47 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bdd6c96ef47>`__, `25fcdc13c6a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/25fcdc13c6a>`__, `12c03024f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/12c03024f3c>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:71
msgid ""
"**IMX bootloader handoff** -- a pre-armed catcher claims the RT1062's "
"bootloader the instant it enumerates (`3d8b63c6859 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3d8b63c6859>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**IMX 開機載入程式交接**\\ ——預先備妥的攔截器會在 RT1062 的開機載入程式列舉的瞬間取得它 (`3d8b63c6859 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3d8b63c6859>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:74
msgid ""
"**macOS warnings** -- Apple Silicon users are told about the \"Allow "
"accessories to connect\" security setting, and RT1062 users when Input "
"Monitoring (needed for firmware updates) is not granted (`742cb4d8c0b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/742cb4d8c0b>`__, `8890eb77834 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8890eb77834>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**macOS 警告**\\ ——會告知 Apple Silicon 使用者「Allow accessories to "
"connect」安全性設定，並在未授予 Input Monitoring（韌體更新所需）時告知 RT1062 使用者 (`742cb4d8c0b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/742cb4d8c0b>`__, `8890eb77834 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8890eb77834>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Viewer-mode shortcuts** -- stray shortcuts that broke viewer mode were "
"disabled, and the Viewer no longer writes its cleared shortcuts into the "
"full IDE's settings (`251b422f642 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/251b422f642>`__, `0d153671c1d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0d153671c1d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**檢視器模式快速鍵**\\ ——會破壞檢視器模式的零散快速鍵已停用，且 Viewer 不再將其清除後的快速鍵寫入完整版 IDE 的設定中 "
"(`251b422f642 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/251b422f642>`__, "
"`0d153671c1d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0d153671c1d>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:86
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "錯誤修正"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:88
msgid ""
"Two review passes over every change since v5.0.0 fixed, among others, the "
"following that apply to the Viewer (`ccea3b17d01 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ccea3b17d01>`__, `71826200611 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/71826200611>`__):"
msgstr ""
"針對自 v5.0.0 以來每項變更的兩次審查，修正了（除其他外）以下適用於 Viewer 的問題 (`ccea3b17d01 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ccea3b17d01>`__, `71826200611 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/71826200611>`__)："

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:93
msgid ""
"The macOS warnings could swallow the \"Yes\" of the firmware-upgrade prompt."
msgstr "macOS 警告可能吞掉韌體升級提示的「Yes」。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:94
msgid ""
"A camera's drive association could lose the race to other volumes, and the "
"single-drive fallback was unreachable when the camera had been plugged in "
"for more than ten seconds (`9877480c304 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9877480c304>`__)."
msgstr ""
"相機的磁碟機關聯可能輸給其他磁碟區的競爭，且當相機已插入超過十秒時，單一磁碟機後備方案無法觸及 (`9877480c304 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9877480c304>`__)。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:98
msgid ""
"The GENX320 event sensor disabled the frame buffer; a saved sensor selection"
" did not survive a restart."
msgstr "GENX320 事件感測器會停用影格緩衝區；儲存的感測器選擇在重新啟動後未能保留。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:100
msgid ""
"Loading a ROM file system onto the camera: Cancel during the write ended "
"silently with a possibly partial ROMFS, and a dfu-util error was reported as"
" success. The bootloader is now asked to leave DFU after a cancelled "
"operation so the camera comes back on its own, and a cancel is no longer "
"reported as a failure (`36b9f96cc12 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/36b9f96cc12>`__). On macOS a successful load was reported as "
"failed (`b908f582b8c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b908f582b8c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"將 ROM 檔案系統載入相機：寫入期間按 Cancel 會無聲結束並可能留下不完整的 ROMFS，且 dfu-util "
"錯誤被回報為成功。取消操作後，現在會要求開機載入程式離開 DFU，讓相機自行恢復，且取消不再被回報為失敗（`36b9f96cc12 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/36b9f96cc12>`__）。在 macOS "
"上，成功的載入曾被回報為失敗（`b908f582b8c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b908f582b8c>`__）。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:106
msgid ""
"On Linux, fwupd briefly claiming the DFU device made firmware and ROM file "
"system operations fail at random; dfu-util is now retried while the device "
"is busy (`5152519737d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5152519737d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上，fwupd 短暫佔用 DFU 裝置會導致韌體及 ROM 檔案系統操作隨機失敗；現在當裝置忙碌時會重試 dfu-"
"util（`5152519737d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5152519737d>`__）。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:109
msgid ""
"Flashing a board without a fallback bootloader, such as the N6, with nothing"
" attached now asks you to reconnect the camera (`2a768c06aef "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2a768c06aef>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在沒有連接任何裝置的情況下燒錄無備用開機載入程式的開發板（例如 N6），現在會要求您重新連接相機（`2a768c06aef "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2a768c06aef>`__）。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:112
msgid ""
"A bricked N6 Classic was repaired with the plain N6 bootloader and firmware;"
" a custom firmware zip onto a board already in bootloader mode flashed the "
"release build instead."
msgstr ""
"變磚的 N6 Classic 曾以一般 N6 的開機載入程式與韌體修復；對已處於開機載入程式模式的開發板載入自訂韌體 zip "
"時，燒錄的卻是正式發行版建置。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:115
msgid ""
"The read flush that runs before protocol detection is bounded (issue #336) "
"(`77cd13af76f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/77cd13af76f>`__),"
" and a camera running a ``main.py`` that prints in a loop now connects "
"immediately (`69e58718aaa <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/69e58718aaa>`__)."
msgstr ""
"協定偵測之前執行的讀取清空現在有上限（issue #336）（`77cd13af76f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/77cd13af76f>`__），且執行迴圈列印的 ``main.py`` "
"的相機現在可以立即連線（`69e58718aaa <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/69e58718aaa>`__）。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:120
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台與工具支援"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:122
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2 (shared with OpenMV IDE)."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 基礎版本：** 14.0.2（與 OpenMV IDE 共用）。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:123
msgid "**Bundled firmware:** v5.0.1."
msgstr "**隨附韌體：** v5.0.1。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:124
msgid ""
"**New boards and sensors:** OpenMV N6 Classic; FLIR Lepton 3.1R and UW."
msgstr "**新開發板與感測器：** OpenMV N6 Classic；FLIR Lepton 3.1R 與 UW。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:127
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "破壞性變更"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:129
msgid ""
"None. The JPG toggle in the frame buffer's title bar is now a JPG Mode / RAW"
" Mode selector."
msgstr "無。影格緩衝區標題列中的 JPG 切換鈕現在是 JPG Mode／RAW Mode 選擇器。"
